      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not really worried about the case where this occurs due to a filesystem error but more over when the user was created and started but before the user was unlocked, it was stopped - in that case, they will receive a bunch of events but they would not have been persisted to CE.\n\nso my question really is - other than the filesystem error, will mkdir fail only in the case where the user does not exist? if yes, then I\u0027m okay with removing the events here.",
